---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How egusto collects, uses and shares information, including advertising cookies.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-claude-cream">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-10 text-sm text-claude-muted">Last updated: 5 October 2026</p>
    <div class="prose-post !mx-0">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information egusto ("we", "this site") collects when you visit
        egusto.online, how it is used, and the choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We don't require accounts, and we don't run a newsletter or contact form. Information is
        collected in these ways:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Cloudflare collects basic traffic information (pages viewed, approximate location, browser type) to keep the site running and secure. Cloudflare Web Analytics does not use cookies.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising data:</strong> Google AdSense may use cookies and similar technologies to show ads and measure their performance (see below).</li>
        <li><strong>Purchases:</strong> If you buy a skill, checkout is handled by Gumroad. We receive the details needed to fulfil your order (name, email and the product bought); payment card details are handled only by Gumroad.</li>
        <li><strong>Email you send us:</strong> If you email us directly, we keep the message to reply to you.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google and its partners use cookies,
        including the DoubleClick (DART) cookie, to serve ads based on your visits to this and other
        websites. You can:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Manage personalised advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</li>
        <li>Opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalised ads at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        <li>Learn how Google uses information from partner sites at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland may be asked for
        consent before advertising cookies are set.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We link to third parties including Gumroad (checkout and downloads), Google (AdSense) and
        Cloudflare (hosting and performance). Each has its own privacy policy, which applies to
        information you give them directly.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site isn't directed at children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their information.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal
        information we hold about you. To make a request, contact us using the details on the
        <a href="/about">About page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
